{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "genji-modern",
  "chunk_id": "genji-modern-chunk-4484",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "秋色越深，八亲王心情越见恶劣。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As the colors of autumn deepened, Prince Hachi's spirits grew ever darker.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他想照例迁居到阿阇梨那清静的山寺中去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He wished, as usual, to move to the quiet mountain temple of the Ajari,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "以便一心不乱地念佛，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so that he might devote himself single-mindedly to chanting the Buddha's name,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "便将身后之事嘱咐两个女儿：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and so he entrusted his affairs after death to his two daughters:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "“世事无常，死别是不能逃避的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"All things in this world are impermanent, and parting through death cannot be avoided.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "如果你们另有可以慰情之人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If you had someone else to comfort your hearts,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "则死别之悲也会逐渐消减。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "then the sorrow of deathly separation would gradually fade.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "但你们两人没有能代替我的保护人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But the two of you have no protector who can take my place,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "身世孤苦伶仃，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and your lives are lonely, bitter, and without support,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "我把你们弃在世间，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "so leaving you behind in this world",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "实在非常痛心！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "truly pains me beyond measure!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "虽然如此，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even so,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "但倘被这一点情爱所妨碍，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "if I were hindered by this small attachment of affection,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "竟使我不得往生，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and it were to keep me from rebirth in the Pure Land,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "永堕轮回苦海之中，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "leaving me forever fallen into the bitter sea of transmigration,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "损失也太大了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "the loss would be far too great.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "我与你们同生在世之时，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "While I have lived in this world together with you,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "也因早已看破红尘，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I had already seen through the vanity of worldly life,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 19,
      "source_text": "故身后之事绝不计较。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and so I have never concerned myself with what would happen after my death.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 20,
      "source_text": "然而总希望你们不但顾念我一人，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yet I still hope that you will not think only of me,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 21,
      "source_text": "又顾念你们已故的母亲的脸面，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but will also consider the honor of your late mother,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 22,
      "source_text": "切勿发生轻薄的念头。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and never let frivolous thoughts arise.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 23,
      "source_text": "若非真有深缘，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Unless there is truly a deep bond of fate,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 24,
      "source_text": "切勿轻信人言而离去这山庄。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "do not lightly believe what others say and leave this mountain villa.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 25,
      "source_text": "须知你们两人的身世命运，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You must understand that the circumstances and fate of you two",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 26,
      "source_text": "与普通世人不同，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "are different from those of ordinary people,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 27,
      "source_text": "必须准备终老在这山乡中。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and you must be prepared to grow old and end your days in this mountain village.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 28,
      "source_text": "只要主意坚定，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "So long as your resolve is firm,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 29,
      "source_text": "自能安然度送岁月。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "you will naturally be able to pass the years in peace.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 30,
      "source_text": "尤其是女子，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "For women especially,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 31,
      "source_text": "如能耐性闭居在这山中，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "if they can patiently remain secluded in these mountains,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 32,
      "source_text": "免得众目昭彰地身受残酷的非难，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and avoid being exposed before all eyes and subjected to cruel criticism,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 33,
      "source_text": "实为上策。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "that is truly the wisest course.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 34,
      "source_text": "两位女公子完全不曾考虑到自己的终身问题，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The two young ladies had never given any thought at all to the question of their own futures,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 35,
      "source_text": "只觉得父亲如果死去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and felt only that if their father were to die,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 36,
      "source_text": "自己片刻也不能生存于世。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "they themselves could not go on living in this world for even a moment.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 37,
      "source_text": "此时听了父亲这般伤心的遗言，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Now, hearing such sorrowful final words from their father,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 38,
      "source_text": "其悲痛不可言喻。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "their grief was beyond words.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 39,
      "source_text": "八亲王心中，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In Prince Hachi's heart,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 40,
      "source_text": "早已抛弃一切俗世之事，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he had long since cast aside all worldly matters,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 41,
      "source_text": "只是多年来和这两个女儿朝夕相伴，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but for many years he had spent morning and evening with these two daughters,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 42,
      "source_text": "一旦忽然别去，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and if he were suddenly to leave them,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 43,
      "source_text": "虽然并非由于不慈，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "though it was certainly not from any lack of fatherly love,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 44,
      "source_text": "但在女儿确是满怀怨恨，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "his daughters would surely feel their hearts full of resentment,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p04484",
      "unit_index": 45,
      "source_text": "怪可怜的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and that was truly pitiful.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
